Subject: [PATCH 03/32] Make capture sessions operable without weakening
 shared-storage safety

Document and package the synchronous file helper while keeping Manager labels, deployment tooling, and source contracts aligned with the runtime implementation.

Constraint: User and userdebug builds must share the same ext_data_rw directory contract without world-writable modes or debug-only runtime dependencies
Rejected: Post-write chmod/chown watcher | canonical files would have an unreadable interval and weak failure semantics
Confidence: high
Scope-risk: moderate
Directive: Keep helper requests path-free and preserve 02770 directories plus 0660 files
Tested: source-contract validator; helper host tests 5/5; bash deployment syntax; OnePlus 9 non-root read/write M9
Not-tested: full user image build is outside the agreed acceptance scope
